  },
  {
   "x": 0.52,
   "y": 3.16,
   "w": 7.46,
   "h": 0.27875,
   "text": "Growth during flight",
   "font": "Arial",
   "font_size": 13.5,
   "color": "#F2B880",
   "word_wrap": false,
   "align": "left",
   "valign": "top",
   "margin": 0.02,
   "bold": true,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "o031",
   "name": "C3-E32 text 31"
  },
  {
   "x": 0.55,
   "y": 3.6,
   "w": 7.4,
   "h": 0.2872222222222222,
   "text": "δₐᵣᵣ / a₀ = (δ₀/a₀) exp(gₘₐₓ H / Uⱼ)",
   "font": "Arial",
   "font_size": 14,
   "color": "#E7F0F3",
   "word_wrap": false,
   "align": "left",
   "valign": "top",
   "margin": 0.02,
   "bold": true,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "o032",
   "name": "C3-E32 text 32"
  },
  {
   "x": 0.55,
   "y": 4.2,
   "w": 7.4,
   "h": 0.25333333333333335,
   "text": "gₘₐₓ is the fastest inviscid growth rate of a cylinder.",
   "font": "Arial",
   "font_size": 12,
   "color": "#B4C7D2",
   "word_wrap": false,
   "align": "left",
   "valign": "top",
   "margin": 0.02,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "o033",
   "name": "C3-E32 text 33"
  },
  {
   "x": 0.4,
   "y": 5.35,
   "w": 12.5,
   "h": 0.2702777777777778,
   "text": "Speed, focusing and survival must all refer to the same emitted liquid state: the same mⱼ, Eⱼ and Uⱼ.",
   "font": "Arial",
   "font_size": 13,
   "color": "#F2B880",
   "word_wrap": false,
   "align": "left",
   "valign": "top",
   "margin": 0.02,
   "type": "text",
   "id": "o034",
   "name": "C3-E32 text 34"
  },
  {
   "x": 0.4,
   "y": 5.95,
   "w": 12.5,
   "h": 0.26180555555555557,
   "text": "Teaching case: mⱼ = 3.927 ng, Eⱼ = 2 nJ gives Uᵣₘₛ ≤ 31.9 m/s and Pⱼ ≤ 1.253×10⁻¹⁰ N s; flight 3.13 µs → δ/a₀ grows from 1 % to 2.26 %.",
   "font": "Arial",
   "font_size": 12.5,
   "color": "#E7F0F3",
   "word_wrap": false,
   "align": "left",
   "valign": "top",
